  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (breaking changes; see \"Upgrading from 1.x\" in the README)\n- SpamDatabaseRule is now an opt-in StopForumSpam lookup (public IPs and MD5 email hashes only, cached, fail-open).\n- Scoring uses noisy-OR, so every triggered rule raises the score.\n- Configured lists replace the defaults instead of being appended to them.\n- Options are validated at startup; AddSpamGuard returns ISpamGuardBuilder.\n- Thread-safe rate limiting (IPv6 grouped per /64), ReDoS-safe and Unicode-aware random text detection, whole-word keywords.\n- New: signed form token, <spam-guard-fields /> tag helper, HttpContext context builders, DisabledRules and FailedRules.\n- Uses the shared ASP.NET Core framework instead of the deprecated Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Abstractions 2.x package.",
